    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the abandoned mansion!</h2><br>You are a regular real estate agent sent to retrieve documents in a sinister mansion.<br>But right from the start, dangerous adventures await you.<br>However, you will meet a friendly cat and a master zombie who are always ready to help.<br><br>This is a first-person horror survival game with standard controls: keyboard and mouse.<br>Here, you need to run, hide, and search for provisions to return home.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple and pleasant controls.<br></li><li>The atmosphere of an abandoned mansion.<br></li><li>Good optimization.<br></li><li>Interesting storyline.<br></li><li>Stylized graphics.<br></li><li>There are achievements and cloud saving.</li></ul>",
